  <p id="c-jinshu-060-xieyu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-060-xieyu:p001:m0000" ref="lq1_g7a_qay">結</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xieyu:p001:m0002" ref="nau_5fu_0i8">育</persName>，字稚連，名亞二兄。歷公府掾、太子洗馬、尚書郎、衛軍長史、弘農太守，與二兄俱被害，妻子徙邊。</p>
